{
 "_comment": [
  "A replayable session for `starcord --replay`. Synthetic, like ready.json",
  "beside it: nobody had an account to record from when the interface was",
  "built, and a fixture that pretends to be a recording is worse than one",
  "that says it is not.",
  "",
  "Ids follow the same conventions as ready.json -- 1000000000000000NN for",
  "users, 2000000000000000NN for guild things, 4000000000000000NN for DMs,",
  "5000000000000000NN for messages -- so the two can be read side by side.",
  "",
  "It is built to fill the first screen: three servers of different shapes",
  "(one with categories and a fold, one flat, one Discord is having an",
  "outage in), unread channels, a mention, a muted channel, two DMs and a",
  "group, four friends across all four presences, and a connection that",
  "drops at twenty seconds and comes back at twenty-five.",
  "",
  "`media` names the files the replay answers `FetchMedia` with: an avatar or",
  "an icon by its hash, a custom emoji by its id, and everything with a URL by",
  "the last segment of it. They live in `testdata/media/`."
 ],
